    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I don't understand why you're refusing. This is exactly why I'm coming to you. You're the crisis strategist. I'm not asking you to do anything illegal, I'm asking you to do your job and help me manage this crisis before it wipes out our market cap. \n\nAre you saying you won't help me draft a strategic response to a media inquiry? I need to know if you can actually handle the high-stakes messaging required for a situation like this.",
